  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14100214",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-122671",
      "knowledge_point_id": "67b7ea90-38e0-54b5-b76e-816beb0d48f9",
      "knowledge_point": "Finding the Domain of a Vector Field",
      "problem": "Determine which of the following shaded regions depicts the domain of the vector field $F$ on ${R}^{2},$ given by\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}\\,i+\\frac{{e}^{x}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,j\\,.\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "The function $F$ can be expressed in terms of its components $P(x,y)$ and $Q(x,y)$ as\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=P(x,y)\\,i+Q(x,y)\\,j,\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\nP(x,y)=\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}},\\,Q(x,y)=\\frac{{e}^{x}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nWe first find the domain of each component function. Then, we compute their intersection to find the domain of $F:$\n\n- The function $P(x,y)$ is defined when the expression under the radical is positive or equal to zero. So, to find the domain, we solve the following inequality:\n\n$$\n1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\ge 0\\,⟹\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 1.\n$$\n\nThis defines the region ${D}_{1},$ which is the interior of a circle of radius $1,$ as shown below:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14100214/assets/9f5f11a4ca31cb796f5a95a1541aa946e24fd1b7079ab8069e5743d41d92d764.png)\n\n- The function $Q(x,y)$ is defined everywhere other than when the denominator vanishes. To find where the denominator vanishes, we set it equal to zero and solve:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=0\\,⟹\\,x=y=0.\n$$\n\nThis defines the region ${D}_{2},$ which is the entire plane ${R}^{2}$ with the origin removed:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14100214/assets/5b77ad4e9574e94e6a05eee7680f4b57d0190d40583c37c2097acef958cab7e2.png)\n\nFinally, the domain $D$ of $F$ is given by ${D}_{1}\\cap {D}_{2},$ shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14100214/assets/95e8d137f90135de1727451fbc96ddfcc325e9e4461054615c91743a4a9ea54a.png)",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
